### Listar
GET http://localhost:3000/cita

###

### Crear
POST http://localhost:3000/cita
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fecha": "2026-06-20",
  "hora": "08:00",
  "doctor": "Dra. María López"
}

###

### Modificar
PUT http://localhost:3000/cita/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fecha": "2026-06-21",
  "hora": "09:30",
  "doctor": "Dr. Carlos Pérez"
}

###

### Eliminar
DELETE http://localhost:3000/cita/1